{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":217044,\"title\":\"WWE Vengeance 2004\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Vengeance (2004) was the fourth annual Vengeance PPV. It was presented by AT&amp;T and took place on July 11, 2004 from the Hartford Civic Center in Hartford, Connecticut and featured talent from the Raw brand.  The main event was Chris Benoit versus Triple H for the World Heavyweight Championship. The predominant match on the card was Randy Orton versus Edge for the WWE Intercontinental Championship. The primary matches on the undercard included Matt Hardy versus Kane in a No Disqualification match and Batista versus Chris Jericho.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2foQq8bz5m6yTvOLvLX3w3KxIjt.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1SRekKY9MQLWJOzbQETUpkoVKYU.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":4,\"year\":2004,\"runtime\":180,\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Drama\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Kevin Dunn\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1061603,\"name\":\"Kevin Dunn\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/32y6nzb5PuUIkXeJ4w3xPeUCm4l.jpg\"},{\"id\":115788,\"name\":\"Paul Levesque\",\"character\":\"Triple H\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gOeQvjY8B9E81f3hDjOTmxx9ig4.jpg\"},{\"id\":567335,\"name\":\"Chris Benoit\",\"character\":\"Chris Benoit\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5WLVCaBLgchfCDjIiOFs1mR1G9q.jpg\"},{\"id\":151043,\"name\":\"Randy Orton\",\"character\":\"Randy Orton\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oyXaGjrKorRz2bsLNdK6CSD0JZa.jpg\"},{\"id\":89888,\"name\":\"Adam Copeland\",\"character\":\"Edge\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rIhGY2Qk3BX7O34j6h7VarvfaA8.jpg\"},{\"id\":90028,\"name\":\"Matt Hardy\",\"character\":\"Matt Hardy\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/96knaV5XcWACxdCUNkTJSMVdwgU.jpg\"},{\"id\":61903,\"name\":\"Glenn Jacobs\",\"character\":\"Kane\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fFPmScGeJTZtQ7F5IEbBjuqkjJy.jpg\"},{\"id\":543544,\"name\":\"Amy Dumas\",\"character\":\"Lita\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1McaozfhLGICnvfrzMWxf6ykwFi.jpg\"},{\"id\":182214,\"name\":\"Lisa Marie Varon\",\"character\":\"Victoria\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bKuzW3BcCR5YMIzXNOzBfYNlp7d.jpg\"},{\"id\":543614,\"name\":\"Nora Benshoof\",\"character\":\"Molly Holly\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8fpOSbLeUpHHIDzGb9zUHr9rRvj.jpg\"},{\"id\":1200118,\"name\":\"Robert Thomas Conway Jr.\",\"character\":\"Rob Conway\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xbXT1Oq207zSAhBv6xZprzQG5DU.jpg\"},{\"id\":1200119,\"name\":\"Sylvain Grenier\",\"character\":\"Sylvain Grenier\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/r52a1w5lqpMtPnZ64PNp5b9zwgI.jpg\"},{\"id\":569166,\"name\":\"Ric Flair\",\"character\":\"Ric Flair\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/la287fQ0JeQvqw5VPe1bYOxg2GD.jpg\"},{\"id\":217277,\"name\":\"Nick Dinsmore\",\"character\":\"Eugene\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qw6WZFJRIQpnTBtG7UhZmTyjXpb.jpg\"},{\"id\":543530,\"name\":\"Dave Bautista\",\"character\":\"Batista\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/snk6JiXOOoRjPtHU5VMoy6qbd32.jpg\"},{\"id\":105656,\"name\":\"Christopher Irvine\",\"character\":\"Chris Jericho\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iPd9jsOvDudtZ9ksAzcET0e1zBU.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":19277,\"title\":\"In Hell\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vE2fYcP07fbIHoouATNErRQuNrw.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3M4JB5PtzOqXBEfHOGh4H90nDPY.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A man must survive a prison where hardened criminals battle to the death for the warden's entertainment.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":376812,\"title\":\"Sultan\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oarT8LL2XE0aPU9kXqrD249Z4rM.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/74bUfGDD0kJ53M334vQcbJRzsI8.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The ageing wrestler Sultan Ali Khan decides to try his luck on the mat again; to do this, he wants to represent his country at the Olympic Games, but first has to overcome personal issues.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Action\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":592643,\"title\":\"Embattled\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/Foi2Via2fIACRJMB4934D5MP3j.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3HbqYk1yo3Dtj9jAtRHNiKNTuET.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The eldest son of a ruthlessly tough MMA champion must fight his way out of the abusive cycle his father has continued.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":463257,\"title\":\"The Peanut Butter Falcon\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qyQcRGvdW3VtxHR4fSDgPOePEip.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/g1Y4fQidcbG1kWLIDRNXIN6xdit.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A down-on-his-luck crab fisherman embarks on a journey to get a young man with Down syndrome to a professional wrestling school in rural North Carolina and away from the retirement home where he’s lived for the past two and a half years.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":840388,\"title\":\"Stardom Tokyo Dream Cinderella 2021 Special Edition\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zq24kLPVDijZLM2RDCZe86CL6Fa.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gqtLMuFg2KDhKONRVnLl2NFWmjF.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Tokyo Dream Cinderella 2021 Special Edition was a professional wrestling event promoted by World Wonder Ring Stardom, held on June 12, 2021 at Ota City General Gymnasium in Tokyo, Japan. Due to the then-ongoing COVID-19 pandemic, this show was pushed back several weeks from its original date, and included the also-rescheduled semi-final and final matches for the 2021 edition of the company's long-running Cinderella Tournament. In the main event, Syuri challenged Utami Hayashishita for the World of Stardom Championship, a match that would become legendary for the promotion, particularly in the United States.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1634122,\"title\":\"Heatwave Over Flowers 5 ~The Only Sauna in the World~\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zVVSEGp1tU2zwBGEji9EhrDq1mn.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/full85ULuHLyEKYkV7fYGRoqvGh.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Heatwave Over Flowers 5 ~The Only Sauna in the World~ was a professional wrestling event promoted by DDT Pro-Wrestling (DDT), primarily focused on the stable The37KAMIINA. It took place on February 14, 2026, at Shinjuku FACE in Tokyo, Japan.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Drama\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":268109,\"title\":\"WWE Extreme Rules 2014\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/e6pWvwBAFq5madOJHgmA7BKPuER.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fSarYhT0btEJbwx2IUWNmQyQcEx.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When playing by the rules gets you nowhere, it's time to get extreme! Don't miss WWE World Champion Daniel Bryan when he defends his title against Kane in an Extreme Rules Match, John Cena battles Bray Wyatt in a Steel Cage and Evolution reunites to challenge The Shield in a Six Man Tag Match at WWE Extreme Rules, Sunday, May 4th at the Izod Center in East Rutherford, New Jersey.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":455362,\"title\":\"WWE Payback 2017\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jsgqaqHDxAKVLA5c31oHOMQXWoC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kAGm5tDHLHusQKETxqcrkStOrgx.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Payback (2017) is an upcoming professional wrestling pay-per-view (PPV) and WWE Network event, produced by WWE for the Raw brand. It will take place on April 30, 2017 at the SAP Center in San Jose, California. It will be the fifth event in the Payback chronology.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1624841,\"title\":\"Sendai Girls' Pro-Wrestling in Sendai PIT\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/x2gfzkSdBy7BRwdMZ4m3eDBxRIx.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/a614PzCE5agsqTQc3noJ8JNsxPe.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Sendai Girls' Pro-Wrestling in Sendai PIT was a professional wrestling event promoted by Sendai Girls' Pro-Wrestling, held on January 23, 2026, at Sendai PIT in Sendai, Miyagi, Japan.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1625146,\"title\":\"Marigold New Years Golden Garden 2026 ~ Day 5\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/thoGIq0RgVxmQDF8L5FMXM6rnfi.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9ockNU1ZZBgwbGHCbfo0MNXOQ3y.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Marigold New Years Golden Garden 2026 ~ Day 5 was a professional wrestling event promoted by Dream Star★Fighting Marigold. It took place on January 30, 2026 at Shinjuku FACE in Tokyo, Japan.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":458459,\"title\":\"WWE Backlash 2017\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4O0NhyAmTlKvHQTJJBxvM69DcgK.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1AKPJ0aPgh9CnZRclEllAy2ffXn.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Backlash (2017) is an upcoming professional wrestling pay-per-view (PPV) event and WWE Network event, produced by WWE for the SmackDown brand. It will take place on May 21, 2017, at the Allstate Arena in the Chicago suburb of Rosemont, Illinois. It will be the thirteenth event in the Backlash chronology, and the second Backlash to be held in the Allstate Arena, after Backlash 2001.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":270284,\"title\":\"Undertaker: The Streak 21-1\",\"poster\":null,\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":5.8,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Documentary that reflects on the WWE career of the Undertaker, the franchise's longest serving wrestler with over two decades of action behind him. Known for his trademark finishing move, the tombstone piledriver, the Undertaker has entered battle with generations of WWE stars. Among those to offer their thoughts on what it is like to face him in the ring are Shawn Michaels, Triple H, Big Show, Randy Orton and Brock Lesnar who ended The Streak.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Action\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"uxfzZjIJUKg\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"ieHXzt2qel4\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"V66VsMNGKDE\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}